  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data above 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 2. 0 5 4 + 1. 2 6 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 9 0 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 2. 0 5 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 6 3 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 9 0 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 3. 9 5 4 \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 1 6 3 3 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 1 1. 5 1 9 + 1. 8 2 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 4 7 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 4 8. 5 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {o} = - 1 1 1. 5 1 9 - 1. 8 2 5 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 4 7 7 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 2 4. 2 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 3 5. 5 4 1 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ 1 6 3 3 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 1 1 4. 7 6 8 + 4. 0 7 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 9 4 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 2. 9 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = - 1 1 4. 7 6 8 - 4. 0 7 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} + 0. 9 4 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 1. 4 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 5 3. 4 0 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ \\end{array}\n$$\nSource: Data from Gronvold (47) who estimated all above 298 K. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data above 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 1633 K, $\\alpha - \\beta$ transition point of Th; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.860$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 2 0 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 1 2. 0 5 4 + 1. 2 6 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 0. 9 0 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 1 2. 0 5 4 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 0. 6 3 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 0. 9 0 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 3. 9 5 4 \\\\ \\end{array}",
      "$$",
